The '''Venka Prime''' are the [[Prime]] variant of the {{Weapon|Venka}}, sporting higher damage, [[critical chance]], [[critical multiplier]], [[status chance]], and [[attack speed]]. It also uniquely has a higher [[Melee#Combo Multiplier|Melee Combo Multiplier]] than all other melee weapons. It was released alongside {{WF|Valkyr Prime}} and {{Weapon|Cernos Prime}}.

This weapon can be sold for {{cc|5,000}}.

==Characteristics==
*This weapon deals primarily {{D|Slash}} damage.
*Stance slot has {{Pol|Madurai}} polarity, matching {{M|Vermillion Storm}}, {{M|Four Riders}}, {{M|Malicious Raptor}} and {{M|Scarlet Hurricane}} ([[Conclave]] only) stance.
*Only weapon with a 13.0x [[Melee#Combo Multiplier|melee combo multiplier]] after 240 hits.
*Innate {{Pol|Naramon}} and {{Pol|Madurai}} polarities.

{{Advantages|
*Fourth highest base damage of all claws, behind {{Weapon|Keratinos}}, {{Weapon|Garuda Talons}} and {{Weapon|Garuda Prime Talons}}.
}}

{{Disadvantages|}}

{{WeaponComparison|Venka}}

==Acquisition==
Unlike most Prime gear, Venka Prime is permanently unvaulted, with relics being obtainable through [[Abandoned_Derelict_Caches|Abandoned Derelict Caches]] in Corpus [[Railjack]] missions.
{{PrimeTable}}
{{BuildAutomatic|type=Weapon}}

===Vaulted===
*On [https://forums.warframe.com/topic/1007828-limbo-prime-access-ending-soon-valkyr-prime-entering-the-vault/ September 11th, 2018], it was announced that Venka Prime would enter the [[Prime Vault]] and be retired from the reward tables on September 25th, 2018. Any preexisting components or fully-built weapons will remain as is.
*Venka Prime, {{WF|Valkyr Prime}}, and {{Weapon|Cernos Prime}} can occasionally be acquired via [[Prime Resurgence]], in addition to having their relics obtainable as part of the aforementioned [[Railjack]] missions.

==Notes==
*The Venka Prime has a modified [[Melee#Combo Counter|melee combo multiplier]] that can reach 13.0x combo at 240 consecutive hits instead of the usual 12.0x combo at 220 hits.

==Tips==
* {{A|Slash Dash}} benefits from Venka Prime's enhanced combo multiplier, the rest of the former pseudo-exalted abilities such as {{A|Landslide}} have their own combo counter now.

==Trivia==
*The Venka Prime is the first weapon to have a modified melee combo counter.
*Before the [[Update 26]] melee changes, the Venka Prime combo multiplier scaled at 0.75x instead of 0.5x like other melee weapons. A similar version of this feature was brought back in [[Update 26#Update 26.1|Update 26.1]] when the Venka Prime was given a cap of 13x combo multiplier instead of 12x.
*Venka Prime was announced alongside {{WF|Valkyr Prime}} and {{Weapon|Cernos Prime}} in a teaser, but when the full trailer was finally shown, Valkyr Prime was using the standard Venka instead of the Venka Prime.

==Bugs== 
*Although the Venka Prime can reach 13.0x combo multiplier, mods that scale with combo multiplier, such as {{M|Blood Rush}}, [[Set Mods#Gladiator Mod Set|Gladiator mods]] or {{M|Weeping Wounds}}, will stop scaling at the usual 12.0x combo multiplier.

